      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: We have 500 transcripts and 300 metabolites measured on the same plasma samples, and I want a separate two-layer partial-correlation network for each sample. I don't remember whether the final QC kept 60 or 70 samples.\nUser follow-up: QC kept 70 samples."
